    - target: {fileID: 721625659305089964, guid: 6397ec779d0acaf48aaf8178c1b624ce, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: The Fuel Logistics Control Lattice (FLCL) takes output data from the
        most recent burn period to create a priority list when distributing fuel
        from supply lines.  This data is populated into the FLCL as a pre-sorted
        list of rates.  Space cannot scale more than linearly for this task; implement
        a sorting algorithm that best fits this scenario.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
