    - target: {fileID: 721625659305089964, guid: 6397ec779d0acaf48aaf8178c1b624ce, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: The mixing control system uses a primitive artificial intelligence to
        program itself.  After trained, it scans through live sensor data from the
        7000 ratio sensors to identify critical values, such as ignition failures,
        structural failsafe thresholds and overburn tolerance.  The Mixing control
        unit needs an algorithm that will iterate through all 7000 sensors and respond
        to any of them with a critical value.  What should you tell it to base its
        behavior on?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
