        sort its available fuel outputs. Sensors will constantly have to re-sort
        available fuel masses, so it can be assumed that the regulators will always
        be randomly pre-sorted before each sort window.  The available memory for
        this task does not scale. Select the correct Sorting algorithm to program
        the regulators.
