      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Liquid fuel regulators must be prioritized based on their response times,
        which tend to be consistent during a launch period and are sorted once at
        the beginning of the launch sequence  It should be expected that up to 80%
        of the liquid fuel regulators will perform at the same efficiency as the
        previous measurement.  Available memory is not a concern for this operation. 
        Select the correct sorting algorithm to program the liquid regulator array.
